This license applies to the code in this repository.

The hexagram texts in data/hexagrams.json are derived from Richard Wilhelm's
1924 German translation "I Ging — Das Buch der Wandlungen", which is in the
public domain in jurisdictions where copyright has expired (Germany: 70 years
post mortem, Wilhelm died 1930 → public domain since 2001).

If you redistribute, please retain the attribution to Richard Wilhelm.
